"""Patina 0.41.0: a stain where a roof's water leaves it, and an Empty told apart.

framing.runoff_orders: streaks under conductor heads and drips under copings; framing.is_empty: an Empty paints
every window, so the bank's painted upper storey no longer reads as one.

Proven: tests/test_runoff.py fails on 0.40.0 with its fixtures present (fails_on_old.out.txt: the bank has no
scuppered side); the clone's suite, 434 passed (suite_clone.out.txt); the slice rebuilt and priced (slice 24).
"""
